[l_english.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_MODERN_MACHINE_GUN]
Modern Heavy Machine Gun (Heavy Armor)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_MODERN_MACHINE_GUN_desc]
Equestria Empire Weapon Upgrade Request #2033 (Case EE-MD-73W-2033S): “Our spies from the Free Equestria have just acquired a blueprint of the newest weapon named ‘Machine Gun’. It is a device that could enable non-unicorns to carry out swift, persistent, long-distance attacks. Additionally, it is an efficient measure for executing rebels, as opposed to using magic spells. We propose placing the weapon orders at Las Pegasus and deploying them to all our non-unicorn soldiers as soon as possible. However, there is only one defect with this otherwise perfect weapon: ...”
§g“... It can also be used by our enemies.”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_MODERN_MACHINE_GUN_short]
Modern Heavy Machine Gun

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_MODERN_MACHINE_GUN]
近代重机枪 (重甲装备)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_MODERN_MACHINE_GUN_desc]
小马利亚帝国武器升级请求#2033（案号EE-MD-73W-2033S）：“我们来自自由小马利亚的间谍刚刚获得了名为‘机枪’的最新武器的蓝图。这是一种可以让非独角兽进行快速、持续、远距离攻击的装置。此外，与使用魔法相比，它是处决叛乱者的更有效措施。我们建议尽快在洛马基订下武器订单并将其列装给我们的所有非独角兽士兵。 不过，这把原本完美的武器有且只有一个缺陷：...”
§g“... 它也可以被我们的敌方使用。”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_MODERN_MACHINE_GUN_short]
近代重机枪
